  "description": "Reverse the first k characters for every 2k characters in the string.",
  "target": 2,
  "pseudocode": "1: function reverseStr(s, k) {\n2:   let arr = s.split('');\n3:   for (let i = 0; i < arr.length; i += 2 * k) {\n4:     let start = i;\n5:     let end = Math.min(i + k - 1, arr.length - 1);\n6:     while (start < end) {\n7:       [arr[start], arr[end]] = [arr[end], arr[start]];\n8:       start++; end--;\n9:     }\n10:  }\n11:  return arr.join('');\n12: }",
